    {
      "id": "b288817d682c-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;+&rsquo;, &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;&times;&rsquo;, &lsquo;-&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; and &lsquo;+&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;-&rsquo;, then which of the following is the value of the expression? 66 &times; 9 &ndash; 3 &divide; 13 + 10",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;+&rsquo;, &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;&times;&rsquo;, &lsquo;-&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;&divide;&rsquo; and &lsquo;+&rsquo; denotes &lsquo;-&rsquo;, then which of the following is the value of the expression?</p>\n66 &times; 9 &ndash; 3 &divide; 13 + 10",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "88",
          "html": "88"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "101",
          "html": "101"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "95",
          "html": "95"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "54",
          "html": "54"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Given: 66 &times; 9 &ndash; 3 &divide; 13 + 10</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:73px;height:25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Symbol</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:105px;height:25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&times;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:105px;height:25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&divide;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:89px;height:25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">-</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:65px;height:25px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">+</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:73px;height:26px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><strong>Meaning</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:105px;height:26px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">+</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:105px;height:26px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&times;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:89px;height:26px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&divide;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:65px;height:26px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">-</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>After changing the expression,</p>\n\n<p>66 + 9 &divide; 3 &times; 13 &ndash; 10</p>\n\n<p>66 + 3 &times; 13 &ndash; 10</p>\n\n<p>66 + 39 &ndash; 10 = 95</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>95</strong> is the correct answer.&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b288817d682c-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct? 64 + 36 &divide; 3 &times; 9 - 32 = 44",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p>\n\n<p>64 + 36 &divide; 3 &times; 9 - 32 = 44</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "64 and 36",
          "html": "64 and 36"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "9 and 64",
          "html": "9 and 64"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3 and 9",
          "html": "3 and 9"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "32 and 36",
          "html": "32 and 36"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><u><strong>BODMAS RULE</strong>:</u></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/03/image.png\" style=\"width: 343px; height: 179px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Option 1) :&nbsp;<span style=\"\">64 and 36</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Given equation:&nbsp;64 + 36 &divide; 3 &times; 9 - 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">By interchanging 64 and 36 in the given equation.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Interchanged equation is :36 + <strong><u>64&nbsp;&divide; 3</u></strong>&nbsp;&times; 9 - 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 36 + <u><strong>21.333&nbsp;&times; 9</strong></u> - 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>36 + 191.997</strong></u></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; </span><u><strong>227.997</strong></u><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;- 32</strong></u> = 44</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 195.997&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&ne; 44</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; LHS&nbsp;&ne; RHS</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Option 2) :&nbsp;9 and 64</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given equation :&nbsp;64 + 36 &divide; 3 &times; 9 - 32 = 44</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">By interchanging 9&nbsp;and 64&nbsp;in given equation.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Interchanged equation is:&nbsp;9<span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ <u><strong>36 &divide; 3</strong></u> &times; 64&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; 9</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ <u><strong>12&nbsp;&times; 64</strong></u>&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>9</strong></u></span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;+ 768</strong></u>&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>777</strong></u></span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;- 32</strong></u> = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; 745&nbsp;&ne; 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; LHS&nbsp;&ne; RHS</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Option 3) :&nbsp;3 and 9</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given equation :&nbsp;64 + 36 &divide; 3 &times; 9 - 32 = 44</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">By interchanging 3&nbsp;and 9&nbsp;in given equation.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Interchanged equation is:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">64 + <u><strong>36 &divide; 9</strong></u>&nbsp;&times; 3&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">64 + <u><strong>4&nbsp;&times; 3</strong></u>&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>64 + 12</strong></u>&nbsp;- 32 = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>76</strong></u></span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;- 32</strong></u> = 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"\">&rArr; 44</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 44</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"\">LHS = RHS</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Option 4) :&nbsp;32 and 36</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given equation :&nbsp;64 + 36 &divide; 3 &times; 9 - 32 = 44</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">By interchanging 32 and 36&nbsp;in given equation.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Interchanged equation is:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">64 + <u><strong>32&nbsp;&divide; 3</strong></u> &times; 9 - 36&nbsp;= 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">64 + <u><strong>10.66&nbsp;&times; 9</strong></u> - 36&nbsp;= 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>64 + 95.94</strong></u> - 36&nbsp;= 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; </span><u><strong>159.94</strong></u><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;- 36</strong></u>&nbsp;= 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; 123.94&nbsp;&ne; 44</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; LHS&nbsp;&ne; RHS</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Thus, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;3 and 9&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
