    {
      "id": "b288817d682c-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If A denotes &lsquo;addition&rsquo;, B denotes &lsquo;multiplication&rsquo;, C denotes &lsquo;subtraction&rsquo;, and D denotes &lsquo;division&rsquo;, then what will be the value of the following expression? (45 D 9) B 5 A 8 B (7 A 3 C 6) C (28 D (4 D 4))",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If A denotes &lsquo;addition&rsquo;, B denotes &lsquo;multiplication&rsquo;, C denotes &lsquo;subtraction&rsquo;, and D denotes &lsquo;division&rsquo;, then what will be the value of the following expression?</p>\n\n<p>(45 D 9) B 5 A 8 B (7 A 3 C 6) C (28 D (4 D 4))</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "29",
          "html": "29"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "38",
          "html": "38"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "82",
          "html": "82"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "32",
          "html": "32"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><strong>BODMAS Rule:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-36bdefaf-7fff-7a49-0b24-14a0688b9b6d\"><span style=\"  background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:351px;height:193px;\"><img height=\"193\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VRwr3bUSZx2WMmS6VvAtyui22uCql_WSzu83HGb5lvVWkNcSPxINupUELHTuov7hxYbjFK9a3jRebrDrovCor2SEbHj0ckjltwkszQPr7YzXta01HUuI3Lz3t0WcFqtkS7l7RlSvea7lNN3uNZFruA\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;\" width=\"351\" /></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>Let us Decode the given sign:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:400px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Symbol</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Mathematical Sign</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>A</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>+</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>B</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&times;&nbsp;</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>C</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>-</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>D</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&divide;&nbsp;</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Given:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">(45 D 9) B 5 A 8 B (7 A 3 C 6) C (28 D (4 D 4))</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong>(45 &divide;&nbsp;9)</strong></u> &times;&nbsp;5 +&nbsp;8 &times;&nbsp;<u><strong>(7 +&nbsp;3 -&nbsp;6)</strong></u> -&nbsp;<u><strong>(28 &divide;&nbsp;(4 &divide;&nbsp;4))</strong></u></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;<u><strong> 5&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;5</strong></u> +&nbsp;<u><strong>8 &times; 4</strong></u> - 28</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>25 + 32</strong></u> - 28</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>57 - 28</strong></u></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <strong>29</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;29&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
      "images": [
