      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒126 - 6 × 22 + <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">63 ÷ 9</span></u> = ? ⇒126 - <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 </span></u></span><u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">×</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> 22</span></u> + 7 = ? ⇒<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">126</span></u> - 132<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> </span></span><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">+ 7</span></u> = ? ⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">133 - 132</span></u> = ? ⇒ <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">1 </span></span>",
