      "solution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">For </span><strong style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">×, ÷</strong>, After interchanging the signs, we get:</p>\n\n<p>56 - 14 + 42 × 5 ÷ 10 = 56 – 14 + 21 = 77 – 14 = 63.</p>\n",
