      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Given that:</p>\n\n<table style=\"border: none;\">\n\t<colgroup>\n\t\t<col width=\"135\" />\n\t\t<col width=\"48\" />\n\t\t<col width=\"47\" />\n\t</colgroup>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"height:0pt\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\">\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b>Sign</b></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center;\">&divide;&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center;\">&times;&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr style=\"height:0pt\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\">\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b>Interchange Sign</b></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\">\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b00ac829-7fff-1637-edbd-133bcdf2168c\"><span style=\"  background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">+</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\">\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b00ac829-7fff-1637-edbd-133bcdf2168c\"><span style=\"  background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">-</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>1) 24 + 84&nbsp;&divide; 12 - 16&nbsp;&times; 7 = 129</p>\n\n<p>Interchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get :</p>\n\n<p>=&nbsp;<u><strong>24&nbsp;&divide; 84</strong></u> + 12&nbsp;&times; 16 - 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;0.285 + <u><strong>12&nbsp;&times; 16</strong></u> - 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>0.285 + 192</strong></u> - 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>192.285 - 7</strong></u></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span>185.285&nbsp;&ne; 129 (False)</p>\n\n<p><strong>2) 24&nbsp;&times; 84 + 12&nbsp;&divide; 16 - 7 = 129</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Interchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get :</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span><strong><span style=\"\">&nbsp;24 -<u> 84&nbsp;&divide; 12</u> + 16&nbsp;&times; 7&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span><strong><span style=\"\">&nbsp;24 - 7 + <u>16&nbsp;&times; 7</u></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span><strong><span style=\"\">&nbsp;<u>24</u> - 7 <u>+ 112</u></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><u><strong><span style=\"\">136 - 7</span></strong></u></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span><strong><span style=\"\">&nbsp;129 = 129 (True)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>3) 24 - 84&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;12 +16&nbsp;&times; 7 = 129</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Interchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;24&nbsp;&times; 84 + <u><strong>12&nbsp;&divide; 16</strong></u> - 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>24&nbsp;&times; 84</strong></u> + 0.75 - 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>2016 + 0.75</strong></u> - 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>2016.75 - 7</strong></u></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;2009.75&nbsp;&ne; 129 (False)</p>\n\n<p>4) 24 - 84&nbsp;&divide; 12&nbsp;&times; 16 + 7</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Interchanged sign with given mathematical sign, we get&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;24&nbsp;&times; 84 + 12 - <u><strong>16&nbsp;&divide; 7</strong></u></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>24&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;84</strong></u> + 12 - 2.285</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>2016 + 12</strong></u> - 2.285</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;<u><strong>2028 - 2.285</strong></u></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">=</span>&nbsp;2025.715&nbsp;&ne; 129 (False)</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;Option 2&quot;.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
