      "questionHtml": "<p>After interchanging the given two signs what will be the values of equation (I) and (II) respectively?</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span>x<span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span> and&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>I. 18 &divide; 3 - 4 &times; 2 + 7</p>\n\n<p>II. 18 &times; 3 &divide; 6 - 8 + 4</p>\n",
