      "question": "Which two numbers from amongst the given options should be interchanged to make the given equation correct? 248 &divide; 4 + 184 &divide; ( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8) = 77",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which two numbers from amongst the given options should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p>\n\n<p>248 &divide; 4 + 184 &divide; ( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8) = 77</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8 and 4",
          "html": "8&nbsp;and 4"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "184 and 77",
          "html": "184&nbsp;and 77"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "184 and 248",
          "html": "184&nbsp;and 248"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4 and 6",
          "html": "4&nbsp;and 6"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>We apply the options to the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage10661.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Given equation:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">248 &divide; 4 + 184 &divide; ( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8) = 77</span></p>\n\n<p>Option 1)&nbsp;8&nbsp;and 4</p>\n\n<p>After Interchanging:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 248 &divide; 8&nbsp;+ 184 &divide; <u><strong>( 4 &times; 6</strong></u> &ndash; <u><strong>2 &times; 4)</strong></u> = 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>248 &divide; 8&nbsp;+ 184 &divide;&nbsp;<u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">(24</span></u><u><strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 8</strong></u><u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">)</span></u>&nbsp;= 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><u><strong>248 &divide; 8</strong></u>&nbsp;+ <u><strong>184 &divide; </strong></u><b><u>16</u></b>&nbsp;= 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><u><strong>31 + 11.5</strong></u> = 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>42.5 &ne;&nbsp;77.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Given equation:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">248 &divide; 4 + 184 &divide; ( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8) = 77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Option 2)&nbsp;184&nbsp;and 77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">After interchanging:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 248 &divide; 4 + 77 &divide; <u><strong>( 4 &times; 6</strong></u> &ndash; <u><strong>2 &times; 8)</strong></u> =&nbsp;184</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 248 &divide; 4 + 77 &divide;&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">(24</span><strong><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&ndash; 16</span></strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">)</span></u><span style=\"\">&nbsp;=&nbsp;184</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><u><strong>248 &divide; 4</strong></u> + <u><strong>77 &divide; </strong></u><b><u>8</u></b>&nbsp;=&nbsp;184</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><u><strong>62 + 9.6</strong></u> = 184</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>71.6 &ne;&nbsp;184.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Given equation:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">248 &divide; 4 + 184 &divide; ( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8) = 77</span></p>\n\n<p>Option 3)&nbsp;184&nbsp;and 248</p>\n\n<p>After Interchanging:</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>184&nbsp;&divide; 4 + 248&nbsp;&divide; <u><strong>( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8)</strong></u> = 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>184&nbsp;&divide; 4 + 248&nbsp;&divide;&nbsp;<u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">(24&nbsp;&ndash; 16)</span></u>&nbsp;= 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><u><strong>184&nbsp;&divide; 4</strong></u> + <u><strong>248&nbsp;&divide; </strong></u><b><u>8</u></b>&nbsp;= 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><u><strong>46 + 31</strong></u> = 77</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><strong>77 = 77.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Given equation:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">248 &divide; 4 + 184 &divide; ( 4 &times; 6 &ndash; 2 &times; 8) = 77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Option 4)&nbsp;4&nbsp;and 6</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">After Interchanging:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;248 &divide; 6&nbsp;+ 184 &divide; <u><strong>( 4 &times; 4&nbsp;&ndash; 2 &times; 8)</strong></u> = 77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;248 &divide; 6&nbsp;+ 184 &divide;&nbsp;</span><u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">(16&nbsp;&ndash; 16)</span></u><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong>248 &divide; 6</strong></u>&nbsp;+ <u><strong>184 &divide;&nbsp;</strong></u></span><u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">0</span></u><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong>41.3 + 0</strong></u> = 77&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;41.3 </span>&ne;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;77</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 3&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
