      "id": "b288817d682c-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "By interchanging the given two signs and numbers which of the following equation will be correct? + and &ndash;, 2 and 4",
      "questionHtml": "<p>By interchanging the given two signs and numbers which of the following equation will be correct?</p>\n\n<p>+ and &ndash;, 2 and 4</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "9 &ndash; 5 &divide; 4 &times; 2 + 8 = 80",
          "html": "9 &ndash; 5 &divide; 4 &times; 2 + 8 = 80"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "7 &times; 4 &ndash; 2 &divide; 1 + 5 = 13",
          "html": "7 &times; 4 &ndash; 2 &divide; 1 + 5 = 13"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "7 &ndash; 8 &divide; 2 + 16 &times; 4 = 18",
          "html": "7 &ndash; 8 &divide; 2 + 16 &times; 4 = 18"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5 + 7 &times; 4 &ndash; 8 &divide; 2 = 5",
          "html": "5 + 7 &times; 4 &ndash; 8 &divide; 2 = 5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/04/BODMAS.png\" style=\" width: 290px; height: 159px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>According to the question, <strong>b<span style=\"\">y interchanging the given two signs and numbers :</span></strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><strong><span style=\"\">+ and &ndash;</span></strong></li>\n\t<li><strong><span style=\"\">2 and 4</span></strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">​So,</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">Option - (1) :&nbsp;9 &ndash; 5 &divide; 4 &times; 2 + 8 = 80</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">​9 +&nbsp;<u><strong>5 &divide; 2</strong></u>&nbsp;&times; 4&nbsp;-&nbsp;8 = 80</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">9 + <u><strong>2.5&nbsp;&times; 4</strong></u></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;8 = 80</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>9 + 10</strong></u> - 8 = 80</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>19 - 8</strong></u> = 80</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>11&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&ne; 80&nbsp;(LHS&nbsp;&ne;&nbsp;RHS)</span></strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Option - (2) :&nbsp;<span style=\"\">7 &times; 4 &ndash; 2 &divide; 1 + 5 = 13</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">7 &times; 2&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><strong>4&nbsp;&divide; 1</strong></u> -&nbsp;5 = 13</span></p>\n\n<p><u><strong><span style=\"\">7 &times; 2</span></strong></u><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ 4 - 5 = 13</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>14 + 4</strong></u> - 5 = 13</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>18 - 5</strong></u> = 13</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>13 = 13 (LHS = RHS)</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Option - (3) :&nbsp;<span style=\"\">7 &ndash; 8 &divide; 2 + 16 &times; 4 = 18</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">​7&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><strong>8 &divide; 4</strong></u>&nbsp;-&nbsp;16 &times; 2&nbsp;= 18</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">7 + 2 -</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;<u><strong>16 &times; 2</strong></u></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 18&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>7 + 2</strong></u> - 32 = 18</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>14 - 32</strong></u> = 18</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">-18&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&ne; 18&nbsp;(LHS&nbsp;&ne;&nbsp;RHS)</span></strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Option - (4) :&nbsp;<span style=\"\">5 + 7 &times; 4 &ndash; 8 &divide; 2 = 5</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>​<span style=\"\">5 -&nbsp;7 &times; 2&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><strong>8 &divide; 4</strong></u>&nbsp;= 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">5 -</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;<u><strong>7 &times; 2</strong></u></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ 2 = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><u><strong>5 + 2</strong></u> - 14 = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><u><strong>7 - 14</strong></u> = 5</p>\n\n<p><strong>-7&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&ne; 5&nbsp;(LHS&nbsp;&ne;&nbsp;RHS)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>&quot;Option - (2)&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
